  "application_conditions": [
    "One module per floating gate-driver reference from a regulated 12 V rail.",
    "Can also feed small loads on the same isolated reference (e.g. an LDO for isolated sensing) within the power budget."
  ],
  "design_considerations": [
    "Size RLIM from the total load using TI's calculator; TI used a lower RLIM where the module also powers sensing.",
    "Power budget: gate-charge power Q_G * f_sw * (VDD-VEE) plus driver quiescent and any shared loads must stay below the module rating at the actual input voltage.",
    "Rated 1.5 W only for 10.8-13.2 V input; size the auxiliary rail and protection accordingly."
